.TH tuevent n 0.1 tclutils
.SH tclutils::tuevent
.PP
A small publish/subscribe event bus. Create independent bus tokens, subscribe command prefixes to named events, and emit events with arguments.
.SS API
.CS
set bus [::tclutils::tuevent::create]
::tclutils::tuevent::subscribe $bus saved {apply {{id} {puts "saved $id"}}}
::tclutils::tuevent::emit      $bus saved 42      ;# -> handler runs, returns 1
.CE
.PP
Commands:
.IP \(bu
\fBcreate\fR → bus token.
.IP \(bu
\fBsubscribe bus event handler\fR — idempotent per handler.
.IP \(bu
\fBunsubscribe bus event handler\fR.
.IP \(bu
\fBemit bus event ?arg ...?\fR — calls each handler at global level with the args appended (subscription order); returns the count. A handler error propagates.
.IP \(bu
\fBhandlers bus event\fR / \fBevents bus\fR.
.IP \(bu
\fBclear bus ?event?\fR — drop one event's handlers or all.
.IP \(bu
\fBdestroy bus\fR.
.PP
Unknown bus → \fB{TCLUTILS TUEVENT BUS}\fR.
